      "description": "iRecorder – Background & Offline Recorder\n\nLooking for a powerful background recorder that works anytime, anywhere?\niRecorder is a smart offline recorder designed to capture high-quality audio even when the app runs in the background.\n\nAdvanced Background Recording\n- Reliable background recording support\n- Record while using other apps\n- Continue recording with screen locked\n- Stable performance with no interruptions\n- Your perfect background recorder app for productivity.\n\nWhether you're recording meetings, lectures, interviews, or voice notes, this background recorder ensures your audio continues recording smoothly — even when your screen is locked or you're using other apps.\n\nTrue Offline Recorder\n\nNo internet required.\n- iRecorder works fully offline, making it a dependable offline recorder wherever you are.\n- Record without Wi-Fi or data\n- All files stored locally\n- Secure and private recordings\n- A complete offline voice recorder you can trust.\n\nAudio Editing & Merge\n- Trim recordings with precision\n- Merge multiple audio files\n- Export in WAV, CAF, or M4A\n- Adjust quality before export\n\nMore than just a recorder — it's a complete audio recording and editing app.\n\nHigh-Quality Audio\n- Choose your preferred recording quality:\n- 8KHz (Low)\n- 22.05KHz (Medium)\n- 44.1KHz (High)\n\nPerfect for interviews, lectures, podcasts, and daily voice notes.\n\nEasy Sharing\nShare your recordings instantly via any app installed on your device.\n\nPrivate & Ad-Free\n- No ads\n- 100% local storage\n- Full control over your recordings\n\nThe Smart Background & Offline Recorder\nDownload iRecorder today and experience seamless background recording with full offline support.",
